.TH CCACHE_SIZE 3 "2026-10-31" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
ccache_size \- get the number of live entries in an LRU cache (type-inferred wrapper)
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/clrucache.h>

ccache_size(cache);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Type-inferred wrapper for clrucache_size(). It takes the same arguments
and gives the same result; clrucache_size(3) has the full contract.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
cache  Cache handle to query
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The number of live entries. It is 0 when cache is CCACHE_NULL,
and 0 when cache is a stale handle that a call already destroyed.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR clrucache_size (3)
